diff --git a/CHANGES_202.74.txt b/CHANGES_202.74.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3547149
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGES_202.74.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+TVStreammerSAT5 202.74
+
+Changes from 202.73:
+- Keep the corrected interlaced cadence: 576i25/1080i25 -> progressive 50 fps.
+- H.264 parser now uses config-interval=-1, inserting SPS/PPS with every IDR.
+- The same every-IDR codec-header policy is applied to H.264/H.265 video passthrough.
+- Existing x264 settings remain: GOP 50 for live transcoding, AUD on, repeat-headers=1, byte-stream output.
+- Audio/video passthrough introduced in 202.73 is preserved.
+
+Reason:
+Late SRT/UDP subscribers could report repeated non-existing PPS/decode_slice_header errors before codec configuration was reacquired. Repeating codec parameter sets on every IDR bounds decoder recovery to the next keyframe without changing the proven 50 fps timing.
